{"componentChunkName":"component---src-pages-new-projects-js","path":"new-projects/in-sadaf-6","result":{"serverData":{"data":{"status":true,"hits":[{"rank":null,"slug":"sadaf-6-dubai-investment-dubai-marina","about":"Sadaf 6 is a magnificent high-rise residential complex located on the seashore in the Jumeirah Beach Residence neighborhood in the Dubai Marina area.The 46-storey building includes residential studio apartments and apartments with 1-3 bedrooms. All these residential units are distinguished by high-quality finishes and amenities. From the windows of the residences there is a beautiful view of the sea and the marina, the city panorama, the Palm Jumeirah island.The infrastructure of the complex includes a beautiful landscaped garden, swimming pools for adults and children (open all year round), restaurants and bars, spa and wellness center, fitness center, shops, laundry, concierge services, cable TV, free Wi-Fi, underground parking, 24-hour security and video surveillance.There are many shops within walking distance:Point , Merry Hill Mall, Alfattan Mall.The nearest medical center of Medcare, JBR, is 570 meters away (it can be reached on foot in 8 minutes). There are also kindergartens and schools in the area.Sadaf 6 is located near Sheikh Mohammed Bin Zayed Street, which allows residents to easily get around the city.Marsa Dubai JBR and JBR Seaside Bus Stations are a 6-9-minute drive away.Dubai International Airport is located 32.3 km from Sadaf 6, and the trip to it takes about 31 minutes, you can get there by car or taxi (depending on traffic congestion).","price":2300000,"title":"Sadaf 6","bitrix":{"id":625,"pf_id":"are.3.3691","source":null,"project_id":"Sadaf","tower_name":null,"campaign_name":"Sadaf 6","property_type":"Apartment","developer_name":"Dubai Investments","project_location":"Jumeirah Beach Residence"},"images":[{"340x252":"https://d3h330vgpwpjr8.cloudfront.net/x/off-plan/1609/images/2024/04/09/340x252/ADscCY27AFAS2IusnYsWRaUDSsZqGtftvei